message: "If you use trialnoise, please cite it as below."
title: trialnoise
abstract: >-
  Variance components of the public Terminal-Bench 2 leaderboard (task, cell, task x cell, trial
  and run), a separation of scaffold from model, and a calculator for how many trials and tasks a
  comparison needs, calibrated on public data and checked on submissions it never saw.
